WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.357
Welcome to Module 5 of the
Attribute-Driven Migration learning path:

2
00:00:04.357 --> 00:00:06.850
build machine configuration packages.

3
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:10.532
This module serves Gate 5 of
the implementation guide,

4
00:00:10.532 --> 00:00:14.950
and takes Chapter 07 of Building
the Attribute-Driven Migration.

5
00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:18.437
For the server settings
machine configuration owns,

6
00:00:18.437 --> 00:00:22.400
the code is a DSC configuration,
and Azure Policy delivers it.

7
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:26.045
You'll follow Learn's steps, see
where their outputs fall short,

8
00:00:26.045 --> 00:00:28.689
and learn the build that
checks between them:

9
00:00:28.689 --> 00:00:32.548
it cleans the MOF so it's the same
every time, checks the package and

10
00:00:32.548 --> 00:00:36.550
the definition, and refuses what
the release registry doesn't allow.

11
00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:40.075
The lab runs offline on Windows,
with nothing signed in.

12
00:00:40.075 --> 00:00:43.246
The code is illustrative:
tested against fixtures,

13
00:00:43.246 --> 00:00:45.790
not against a production subscription.
